<BaseLayout title="Accessibility"><div class="wrap static-page"><span class="eyebrow">For everyone</span><h1>Learning should be accessible.</h1><div class="prose"><p>We design for readable text, keyboard-friendly navigation, visible focus indicators, clear headings and mobile access. We avoid automatic media playback and use Chinese characters alongside English explanation where possible.</p><p>The site is under development and has not completed a formal accessibility audit. Testing with assistive technologies and fixing identified issues are launch requirements.</p><p><a href="/learn/">Explore beginner lessons</a>.</p></div></div></BaseLayout>
